// packageDirectory: the template of a Newton 1.x store's package directory, the
// system soup entry tagged "Packages" (extrasSoupName) whose pssids array lists
// the store's packages; |Convert1.XPackages| (builtinFunctions) reads and
// removes such an entry when it converts an old store.

packageDirectory := {tag: extrasSoupName, pssids: [|Array|: ]};
